    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa9ee31afd83f7a93cdefce1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向她说明，\n在疲惫的状态下继续训练也不会有什么效果。\n事实上现在的成绩就是下滑了非常多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d90fb26ba73bce5ab8153a17b1e7bae31eda7e890e60e3140cb268869716d0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
