    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e61b067b8b59e5e64d0356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是因为身体达到极限就停止……\n是没办法抵达更远的目标的！\n要获得凌驾于魔咒之上的实力就要更拼命！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10bc15f6b86c2a913aa4fdf51e625f971aa772e2bd7670676a16b03f9015a5b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
