    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa2f42ccda9a92695a6e326",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "况且，小北都还在努力呢！\n我也不可以输给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "432942639f75e805c012fb905a5dea3c957763b576615550f77b0dd300a0cb3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f31bb6271f71193d14e33c3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的目光停留在离我们一段距离，\n流着满身大汗却仍旧\n一个接一个完成训练的北部玄驹身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00aae5ea0ff38e286c77dea0621eee396736227d485916a9afad284fad3aed95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36136a257dd413036be13ac8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我还是认为北部玄驹那种凭着气势和意志力，\n以超越极限为目标的训练方式\n并不适合里见光钻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49cb7b210c1e5402a8baf23aa9622b10c8751da125ee9ccea79a6853aaf3b152",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067104.json",
      "json_path": [
